  "prefLabel": "Puc 2102.07 Distribution system information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2102.07 “Distribution system information” means information concerning the specific location or characteristics of part or all of the utility’s distribution system or other non-customer-specific non-public information that is not available on an equivalent basis to non-affiliated competitors.\n\nSource. #7884-A, eff 5-2-03, EXPIRED: 5-2-11\n\nNew. #9921, eff 5-3-11; ss by #10909, eff 8-8-15 (from Puc 2102.07); ss by #14556, eff 4-15-26, EXPIRES: 4-15-36 (formally Puc 2012.06)",
